    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaagh--!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch out! !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine... It's just a scratch, don't worry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not good enough... At this rate, they're going to close in on us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've already found the weak point in their line, but without reinforcements, it's taking all we have just to hold them back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Please hold out a bit longer! Focus your fire on the ranged enemies!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our Casters will take care of their vanguard!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, good! This is how things should be! Next up, F3, E5!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "This bloody brat...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excellent! Now, B4, B5!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "The enemy is now trying to flank us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take two Defenders and a Sniper! Just keep them busy!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And next! H2, H6!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "They... they're rushing our defensive line!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Vanguards, flush them out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right, let me see how you struggle!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, Casters. move to C7. Capture their Rook!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enemy Casters have appeared! So far, they're hiding behind their Defenders!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's too late! Take cover!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
