    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaargghh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now be snuffed out, like flames before a storm!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is he really commanding his troops like that? How can he give such precise orders just by barking out chess moves?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those same disorderly thugs have been turned into an army under his command...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "At this rate, he's going to keep exploiting the advantage he gets through his leadership...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "On the other hand, if we manage to suppress him, they'll fall into disarray!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't give them even the slightest opening!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn it, we're running out of time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't allow ourselves to be stalled any longer!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there some way to turn the tables... anything?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're going to be... Doctor's going to...",
        "tag": "name",
